  "body": "[MIME types for fonts](https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/commit-snapshots/ad24d0b6cd60962f8d007fde84ff609640e8e95b/#mime-type-groups) should reflect recent changes introduced by the [RFC 8081](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc8081) and [registered at IANA](https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/media-types.xml#font), isn't it?\r\n\r\nObsolete|Common\r\n---|---\r\n`application/font-ttf`|`font/ttf`\r\n`application/font-cff`|`font/collection`\r\n`application/font-off`|`font/otf`\r\n`application/font-sfnt`|`font/sfnt`\r\n`application/font-woff`|`font/woff`\r\n| |`font/woff2`",
